es":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","review_id":"DUYz20jSb3eCx1L3HqqHjQ","date":"2017-04-28T13:53:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9360692501068115,"text_excerpt":"My fiancé and I dined here recently. We had the Vegetarian Muffuletta, Cheese Plate, and a salad. Fruit and vegetables were fresh. Meats and cheeses were all quality. Everything I tasted here impressed me, even the bread had a remarkable flavor. Portions here are pretty big, plates are made to be shared. They have a great selection of alcoholic drinks and a decent selection of soft drinks. Staff is friendly, attentive, and quick to get your order out. This has become my favorite place to visit in the French Market."},{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","review_id":"uTtdGTDeL9YTjIiu15-K_Q","date":"2014-12-31T18:04:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9359601736068726,"text_excerpt":"As part of my best of list for 2014, I bring you Alberto's with the most outstanding Muffaletta. Great bread, house made olive salad and much better quality meat than that \"other\" place. Get it toasted and enjoy. I generally try to avoid food in the French Market, with the exception of the new farmers market that just opened in there on Wednesdays (yay!). After I moved around the corner from the Market, and on one particular day where I was craving the salty, briney taste of olive salad- I decided to give this little sandwich and cheese stand a shot. Soooooooo glad I did. Their muffaletta is great. You can get a quarter sandwich (plenty for one person and perfect for two people to share t..."},{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","review_id":"AfoGBTWTnxAGJxgajduwVA","date":"2018-10-05T19:41:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9348233938217163,"text_excerpt":"it was a little bit of a wait but the food was fantastic! i got the goat cheese and beet grilled cheese, the richness of the goat cheese played well with the earthiness of the beets to create a well rounded sandwich. the caprese sandwich i had here was the best one i've had, there is plenty of mozzarella and the balsamic sends it over the top! if you're visiting the french market make sure you stop by this place!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","photo_id":"HQh4-I7fAqOcZ1Uhl0Orng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HQh4-I7fAqOcZ1Uhl0Orng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9236245155334473},{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","photo_id":"4emNN-2ytjeKEAnWtI53XA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4emNN-2ytjeKEAnWtI53XA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8379583954811096},{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","photo_id":"XQBmEacrtsgSCzeJ2eS7sA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XQBmEacrtsgSCzeJ2eS7sA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.808285653591156},{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","photo_id":"ql-00sY-UMVdvn0-lNCUAQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ql-00sY-UMVdvn0-lNCUAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8055952787399292},{"business_id":"AW81jJyQA8264WcUT-4JzA","photo_id":"kXKACKJddDGiPZlEtZnBeA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kXKACKJddDGiPZlEtZnBeA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7715703845024109}]},"notebook_case":null}
